    "body": "IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the Parties have executed this Agreement as of the Start Date.\n\nSUBSCRIBER: MidwestAF Properties LLC\n\nBy (typed signature): [SIGNATURE_NAME]  Printed name: Phil Klein, Owner/Member  Date: [SIGNATURE_DATE]\n\nBy (typed signature): [CO_SIGNATURE_NAME]  Printed name: Sydney Klein, Owner/Member  Date: [CO_SIGNATURE_DATE]\n\nHOST: Summers Vacations LLC\n\nBy: Brian Summers, Authorized Person\n(Host countersigns after receipt.)"
